<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECHS LEAD INDIA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS LEAD INDIA 1-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PRIBRAM, Czech Republic 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic</p>
<p>took a 1-0 lead over India in their Davis Cup world group first</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles on Friday.</p>
<p>Result</p>
<p>Petr Korda beat Mahesh Bhupathi 6-3 6-7 (2-7) 6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
